{"meta":{"id":"log-analyzer","category":"it/tools/my-convenience","title":"로그 시간대 비교 분석기","subtitle":"","summary":"로그 파일 4개까지 시간대별 레벨 · 카테고리 건수 비교, 5MB 청크 읽기, 엑셀 저장 — 운영 서버 4대 하루치(533 MB · 420만 줄) 실측 분석과 집계 버그 3개 수정","tags":["로그","log","분석","xlsx","sheetjs"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"myConvenience","updatedAt":""},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>LOG</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">로그 시간대 비교 분석기</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 로그 파일 4개까지 시간대별 레벨 · 카테고리 건수 비교, 5MB 청크 읽기, 엑셀 저장 — 운영 서버 4대 하루치(533 MB · 420만 줄) 실측 분석과 집계 버그 3개 수정</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">기능</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">로그 파일을 최대 4개까지 올려 <strong>시간대별(1분 / 10분 / 1시간)</strong>로 로그 레벨 · 카테고리 건수를 집계하고, 파일끼리 나란히 비교하는 표를 만듭니다. 결과는 SheetJS(xlsx)로 엑셀(log_analysis.xlsx) 저장이 됩니다.</p><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">단계</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">파일 선택</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">최대 4개, 슬롯별 추가 · 삭제</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">읽기</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">5MB 단위로 잘라 스트리밍 디코딩 — 큰 로그 파일도 한 번에 메모리에 올리지 않음</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">한 줄 해석</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS,ms LEVEL [카테고리]</code> 형식을 정규식으로 분리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">집계</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">시간 키 → 파일 → 레벨 → {전체 건수, 카테고리별 건수}</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">출력</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">시간대 × 파일 표, 엑셀 저장</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">실행 화면</h2></div><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/tools/my-convenience/assets/log-analyzer/01-result.png\" alt=\"로그 2개를 1시간 단위로 비교 — 레벨별 건수와 카테고리별 건수\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">로그 2개를 1시간 단위로 비교 — 레벨별 건수와 카테고리별 건수</figcaption></figure><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">화면의 로그는 설명용으로 만든 가상 로그(was1-app.log · was2-app.log)입니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">큰 파일 나눠 읽기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">async function processLargeFile(file, fileIdx, unit) {\r\n  const chunkSize = 5 * 1024 * 1024; // 5MB\r\n  let offset = 0;\r\n  let decoder = new TextDecoder(&#x27;utf-8&#x27;);\r\n  let leftover = &#x27;&#x27;;\r\n\r\n  while (offset &lt; file.size) {\r\n    const chunk = file.slice(offset, offset + chunkSize);\r\n    const arrayBuffer = await chunk.arrayBuffer();\r\n    let text = decoder.decode(arrayBuffer, {stream: true});\r\n    text = leftover + text;\r\n\r\n    const lines = text.split(&#x27;\\n&#x27;);\r\n    leftover = lines.pop(); // 마지막 줄은 아직 안 끝났을 수 있음\r\n\r\n    lines.forEach(line =&gt; processLine(line, fileIdx, unit));\r\n    offset += chunkSize;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  // 마지막 남은 줄 처리\r\n  if (leftover) processLine(leftover, fileIdx, unit);\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">청크 경계에서 잘린 마지막 줄은 leftover 로 남겨 다음 청크 앞에 붙입니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">한 줄 해석과 시간대 집계</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">function processLine(line, fileIdx, unit) {\r\n  // 레벨 뒤 공백은 1칸 이상 (log4j %-5p 패딩: &#x27;INFO  [&#x27; · &#x27;WARN  [&#x27; 은 2칸이라 1칸 고정이면 통째로 빠졌다)\r\n  const match = line.match(/^(\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}) (\\d{2}):(\\d{2}):\\d+,\\d+ (\\w+)\\s+\\[([^\\]]+)]/);\r\n  if(!match) return;\r\n  const [_, day, hour, minute, level, category] = match;\r\n  // 시간 키는 로그에 찍힌 시각 문자열 그대로 만든다 (Date → toISOString 은 UTC 로 바뀌어 KST 기준 9시간 밀렸다)\r\n  let mm = minute;\r\n  if(unit===60) mm = &#x27;00&#x27;;\r\n  else if(unit===10) mm = String(Math.floor(Number(minute)/10)*10).padStart(2,&#x27;0&#x27;);\r\n  const timeKey = `${day} ${hour}:${mm}`;\r\n\r\n  data[timeKey] ??= {};\r\n  data[timeKey][fileIdx] ??= {};\r\n  data[timeKey][fileIdx][level] ??= { total:0, categories:{} };\r\n  data[timeKey][fileIdx][level].total++;\r\n  data[timeKey][fileIdx][level].categories[category] =\r\n    (data[timeKey][fileIdx][level].categories[category]||0)+1;\r\n}</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">엑셀 저장</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">function exportExcel() {\r\n      setLoading(true);\r\n  const rows = [];\r\n  const header1 = [&#x27;시간&#x27;], header2=[&#x27;&#x27;];\r\n  files.forEach((f,i)=&gt;{ header1.push(`파일${i+1}`,); header2.push(&#x27;로그&#x27;); });\r\n  rows.push(header1,header2);\r\n\r\n  Object.keys(data).sort().forEach(time=&gt;{\r\n    const row = [time];\r\n    for(let i=0;i&lt;MAX_FILES;i++){\r\n      row.push(formatLevelBlock(data[time][i]));\r\n    }\r\n    rows.push(row);\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  const wb = XLSX.utils.book_new();\r\n  const ws = XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet(rows);\r\n  ws[&#x27;!cols&#x27;] = [{wch:18}, ...Array(MAX_FILES).fill({wch:60})];\r\n  XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, ws, &#x27;LogAnalysis&#x27;);\r\n  XLSX.writeFile(wb,&#x27;log_analysis.xlsx&#x27;);\r\n      setLoading(false);\r\n}</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">실제 운영 로그로 테스트</h2><span class=\"ml-auto text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">2026-01 · 로그 하루치</span></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">공공 웹 서비스 운영 서버 4대(JBoss 계열 WAS 3대 — Undertow · Infinispan · Weld, 스케줄러 1대)의 <strong class='text-stone-900'>하루치 로그 533 MB · 420만 줄</strong>을 넣어 봤습니다. 서버 이름 · 앱 이름 · 패키지 · IP 는 옮기지 않고 집계 값만 적었습니다.</p><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">서버</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">크기</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">전체 줄</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">형식 맞는 줄</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">ERROR</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">WARN</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">FATAL</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">WAS 1</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">188 MB</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,445,302</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,242,567 (86%)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">8,649</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,459</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">10</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">WAS 2</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">138 MB</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,096,225</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">797,764 (73%)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">8,895</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,973</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">스케줄러</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">14 MB</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">115,588</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">63,641 (55%)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">9</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">WAS 4</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">193 MB</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,543,616</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,120,897 (73%)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">9,513</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,656</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>합계</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>533 MB</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>4,200,731</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">3,224,869</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>27,066</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">5,088</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">13</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">ERROR · WARN 주요 카테고리 (WAS 3대 합계)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">카테고리</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">레벨</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">건수</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">stderr</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">ERROR</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">16,273 (60%)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">화면 프레임워크의 SEVERE · INFO 로그와 디버그 출력이 표준 에러로 나가 전부 ERROR 로 찍힘 — 장애가 아닌 <strong class='text-stone-900'>노이즈</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Infinispan InvocationContextInterceptor</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">ERROR</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">5,985</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">노드 간 세션 캐시 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>PutKeyValueCommand</code> · <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>GetKeyValueCommand</code> 타임아웃</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">io.undertow.request</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">ERROR</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">3,754</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">에러 페이지를 만들다가 다시 ServletException (원인이 세션 캐시 예외) — 사용자에게 에러 화면조차 못 줌</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">org.infinispan.CLUSTER / ClusterTopologyManager</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">WARN</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,896</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">노드가 코디네이터가 된 뒤 클러스터 상태 복구 실패, RPC 처리 중 예외</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">org.jboss.as.server.deployment</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">WARN</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,012</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">배포 관련 경고 — 하루 중 재배포 · 재기동이 있었던 흔적</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">시간대별 요청량과 오류 (전체 줄 / ERROR)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">시각</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">WAS 1</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">WAS 2</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">WAS 4</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">08시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">72,695 / 105</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">10,185 / 0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">91,469 / 17</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">09시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">151,042 / 161</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">183 / 9</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">147,311 / 1,049</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">10시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">233,353 / 1,038</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1,850 / <strong class='text-stone-900'>701</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">168,047 / 1,090</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">11시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">174,510 / 236</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">326 / 0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">177,849 / 204</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">13시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">175,008 / 974</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">33,644 / 1,411</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">169,836 / 600</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">14시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">38,471 / 1,006</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">26,236 / 848</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">39,338 / 941</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">15시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">21,015 / 1,102</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">42,321 / 1,758</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">39,860 / 1,506</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">16시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">32,372 / <strong class='text-stone-900'>1,807</strong></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">43,448 / 1,064</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">48,709 / <strong class='text-stone-900'>3,240</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">17시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">43,667 / 1,038</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">53,046 / 1,029</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>1,238</strong> / 7</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">18시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>288</strong> / 0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>173,136</strong> / 541</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>27</strong> / 4</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">19시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">58,596 / 433</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>191,802</strong> / 547</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">19,967 / 317</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">21시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">30,719 / 335</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">61,655 / 458</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">31,257 / 324</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">로그에 찍힌 시각 기준입니다. 12 · 20 · 22시 등 특이점이 없는 시간대는 뺐습니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">분석해서 알게 된 것</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">주제</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">ERROR 의 60% 가 노이즈</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">stderr 로 나간 프레임워크 로그가 ERROR 로 분류돼, 진짜 장애 신호(세션 캐시 · 요청 실패)가 묻혀 있었다. 레벨만 보고 경보를 걸면 오탐이 대부분이 된다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">오류는 부하를 따라가지 않음</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">WAS 1 · 4 는 요청이 몰린 10~13시보다 요청이 줄어든 14~16시에 ERROR 가 더 많았다. 트래픽이 아니라 노드 간 세션 복제(클러스터) 문제로 보는 근거</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">노드 사이 트래픽 쏠림</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">WAS 2 는 09~12시 거의 비어 있다가(10시는 1,850줄 중 701건이 ERROR) 18~19시에 하루 최대, 그 시각 WAS 1 · 4 는 거의 0 — 노드 재기동이나 로드밸런서 전환으로 <strong class='text-stone-900'>추정</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">스케줄러는 기준선</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1시간마다 약 2,620줄로 일정해 정상 패턴의 기준이 된다. 11 · 13시에만 외부 연계 API 접속 실패와 쿼리 타임아웃 ERROR 9건</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">로그 위생</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">클라이언트 IP · 서버 호스트명이 표준 에러로 평문 출력되고 있었다(각 수백 건). 접근 기록은 정해진 로거 · 마스킹 규칙으로 남겨야 한다</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">테스트하며 찾은 도구 문제와 수정</h2><span class=\"ml-auto text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">2026-11-10 수정</span></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">문제</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">INFO · WARN 이 통째로 빠짐</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">정규식이 레벨 뒤 공백을 1칸으로 고정했는데, log4j <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>%-5p</code> 패딩 때문에 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>INFO  [</code> · <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>WARN  [</code> 은 2칸이다. 그래서 ERROR · DEBUG · FATAL 만 집계되고 있었다 → <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>\\s+</code> 로 수정</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">시간이 9시간 밀림</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>new Date('YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM')</code> 는 로컬(KST) 시각인데 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>toISOString()</code> 은 UTC 로 바꿔, 하루치 로그가 전날 15시 ~ 당일 14시로 그려졌다 → 로그에 찍힌 시각 문자열로 키를 직접 만들도록 수정</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">빈 슬롯이 있으면 열이 어긋남</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>files.filter(f => f)</code> 로 빈 슬롯을 빼고 0번부터 다시 번호를 매겨, 3번 슬롯 파일이 '파일2' 열에 그려졌다 → 슬롯 번호를 그대로 쓰도록 수정</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">형식 밖 줄은 세지 않음</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">스택 트레이스처럼 시각으로 시작하지 않는 줄(14~45%)은 그대로 빠진다. 건수 비교 용도라 두고, 예외 본문 분석은 따로 한다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">교차 검증</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">파이썬으로 같은 로그를 따로 집계해 비교하다가 위 문제를 찾았다. 수정한 코드의 함수를 Node 에서 실제 로그에 그대로 돌려 레벨별 건수 · 시간대별 ERROR 가 파이썬 결과와 모두 같은 것을 확인했다 (533 MB 를 파이썬으로 약 4.4초)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/tools/my-convenience/log-analyzer","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"tools","title":"기타 작업물","path":"it/tools"},{"id":"my-convenience","title":"MyConvenience (Electron)","path":"it/tools/my-convenience"}],"hasImage":false}